{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a chaotic, action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or face the hordes solo as you dive deep into monster-filled dungeons, unlock powerful heroes, and smash your way through epic, fast-paced battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Fight_Tonight!.gif?t=1747200137\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/DungeonRampage_Features.png?t=1747200137\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo offers: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Unique Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first League</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 unique weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, like the main game, includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-Op Dungeon Crawling</strong>: Team up with up to 4 players in online co-op or battle your way solo through thrilling, premade or procedural dungeons packed with enemies, traps, and treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1747200137\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Heroes</strong>: Choose from a variety of unique heroes, each with their own skills, weapons, and playstyles. Who will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Hereos.png?t=1747200137\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Gear and Abilities</strong>: Level up your heroes and unlock powerful weapons with unique abilities to suit your playstyle. Hundreds of items and skill upgrades to ensure endless strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Train.png?t=1747200137\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: With procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are the same. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Map.jpg?t=1747200137\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072340?t=1747200137","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072340?t=1747200137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/c08c8710daa9fb288739509050f112a9704162b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747200137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/c08c8710daa9fb288739509050f112a9704162b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747200137","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a chaotic, action-packed adventure in <i>Dungeon Rampage</i>, the ultimate revival of the cult-classic online multiplayer dungeon crawler! Team up with friends or face the hordes solo as you dive deep into monster-filled dungeons, unlock powerful heroes, and smash your way through epic, fast-paced battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Fight_Tonight!.gif?t=1747200137\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/DungeonRampage_Features.png?t=1747200137\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo offers: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Unique Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first League</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 unique weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, like the main game, includes: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-Op Dungeon Crawling</strong>: Team up with up to 4 players in online co-op or battle your way solo through thrilling, premade or procedural dungeons packed with enemies, traps, and treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1747200137\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Heroes</strong>: Choose from a variety of unique heroes, each with their own skills, weapons, and playstyles. Who will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Hereos.png?t=1747200137\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Gear and Abilities</strong>: Level up your heroes and unlock powerful weapons with unique abilities to suit your playstyle. Hundreds of items and skill upgrades to ensure endless strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Train.png?t=1747200137\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: With procedurally generated dungeons, no two runs are the same. Face new challenges every time you play, from massive boss battles to cleverly hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/extras/Map.jpg?t=1747200137\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Gamebreaking Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3053950","name":"Dungeon Rampage"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072340/e0372575fbad755689fafc74960f14ab35db68de/header.jpg?t=1747200137","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124878,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124878/movie480.mp4?t=1747200135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124878/movie_max.mp4?t=1747200135"},"name":"Dungeon Rampage Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257124878/42643895bc54a90ae5531031d711fab8edc17600/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747200135","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124878/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747200135","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124878/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747200135"}}],"name":"Dungeon Rampage Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 860<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 730<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 8100<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT1030<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gamebreaking Studios"],"ratings":{"de